<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  launchd template for the overnight privacy baseline sweep.

  A baseline sweep re-asks the local model about EVERY document in every
  in-scope collection. Measured on this corpus: 48-51 min for a 681-window
  collection, 56-77 min for a 428-window one, 148-180 min for a 2430-window one
  — 4.3 to 5.1 hours for the three together. 01:00 puts all of that ahead of the
  installed index jobs, the earliest of which is 08:00 local.

  ONE-SHOT BY CONSTRUCTION. The script is passed the "once" flag below, so it
  unloads this job when it finishes: a baseline is a night you decide to spend,
  and an unattended 5-hour local-model job that quietly became nightly is the
  failure this avoids. Re-arm it by loading the plist again.

  (The flag is spelled out in ProgramArguments rather than named here because a
  double hyphen cannot appear inside an XML comment. launchd's own parser
  tolerates one; plistlib does not, and plistlib is what reads this file in
  main/runtime/indexing_schedule.py to report the job's schedule.)

    sed 's|__HUGINN__|'"$PWD"'|g' scripts/com.huginn.privacy-sweep.plist.example \
      > ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.huginn.privacy-sweep.plist   # run from the huginn root
    launchctl load ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.huginn.privacy-sweep.plist

  To disarm before it fires, or to re-check that it disarmed itself:

    launchctl list | grep com.huginn.privacy-sweep
    launchctl unload ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.huginn.privacy-sweep.plist

  The paths are placeholders on purpose — an absolute home path in a public repo
  is a distributor fingerprint, the same shape main/privacy/index_scan.py check 10
  blocks and alias_registry rewrites. PATH must include the uv install dir
  (/opt/homebrew/bin): launchd runs with a minimal environment, so uv and python3
  will not resolve without it. caffeinate -s keeps the machine awake for the
  duration — it cannot wake a sleeping machine to start the job, but it stops a
  five-hour sweep from being suspended halfway through.
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <key>Label</key>
    <string>com.huginn.privacy-sweep</string>

    <key>ProgramArguments</key>
    <array>
        <string>/usr/bin/caffeinate</string>
        <string>-s</string>
        <string>/bin/bash</string>
        <string>__HUGINN__/scripts/overnight_privacy_sweep.sh</string>
        <string>--once</string>
    </array>

    <key>WorkingDirectory</key>
    <string>__HUGINN__</string>

    <key>EnvironmentVariables</key>
    <dict>
        <key>PATH</key>
        <string>/opt/homebrew/bin:/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin</string>
    </dict>

    <!-- 01:00 local time: ~5 h of sweeping still ends well before the 08:00 job. -->
    <key>StartCalendarInterval</key>
    <dict>
        <key>Hour</key>
        <integer>1</integer>
        <key>Minute</key>
        <integer>0</integer>
    </dict>

    <key>StandardOutPath</key>
    <string>__HUGINN__/logs/launchd_privacy_sweep.out</string>
    <key>StandardErrorPath</key>
    <string>__HUGINN__/logs/launchd_privacy_sweep.err</string>

    <key>RunAtLoad</key>
    <false/>
</dict>
</plist>
